GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_InstallableExpertise> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_InstallableExpertise> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_InstallableExpertise> ;
    narr:childCount "47"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "08dbf2d09d3a625ffd65c009778ee0a98c8715fd" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative tracks how a product thesis about [renaming memory into installable expertise](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24) — grounded in [a citable-perspective technical moat](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26) and [a rhetorical framing of the target expert market](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_28) — extends through [delegation of expert work](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_30) toward [an Apple-not-toolbox platform ambition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_32). A beta thread tests it against a live user: [a Knowledge Packager classification](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_38) [structurally identical to another packager profile](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_37), whose onboarding surfaces [the freeze-after-connect moment](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_58), [a prescription for plainer tool-language prompts](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60), and [backend concepts experienced as entirely foreign](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63), alongside [an earlier feedback-capture gap](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_55). A later thread turns on product identity itself: [the phone-number tagline flagged as incorrect](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_3), [Tanya's channel-not-product correction](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_8), [a replacement positioning as curated expertise installation](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_41), and [the structural diagnosis of why the wrong claim keeps re-embedding](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_5) — feeding [a temporality-ontology gap](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_33) and [a newly named subgraph-scoping gap](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_36). The register across the org-lane children runs antithesis-first with analogy and rhetorical-question moves.""" ;
